{"id":8915585,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/9012","number":9012,"state":"merged","title":"fix(flash_attn): 修复 GS 布局 mask 拷贝 midGCount=0 时的 UB 越界","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9012","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9012/issues","body":"## 描述\nFlashAttn GS 布局 mask 拷贝在 gs1dealNum > s1Size 且 midGCount == 0 时，buffer 内模板写入超出 UB 边界，导致相邻 ping-pong slot 的 mask 数据被破坏，精度失败。\n\n## 改动\n- 将 headS1Count 和 midGCount 计算提到 if 之前，midGCount == 0 时走 if 分支直接从 GM 两段拷贝，避免 buffer 内模板越界\n- 修复 midGCount 计算 uint32_t 下溢：gs1dealNum < headS1Count 时用三目运算保护\n- else 分支 head DataCopy 增加 headS1Count > 0 保护\n- 两份 attenmask_gs1.h（flash_attn 和 common）同步修改\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#3886\n\n## 测试\n- 原始用例 PA_BBND_BNSD_WIN128_LSE（config=2, s2BaseSize=128）：PASS，MaxAbsErr=0.00476\n- Risk1 用例（S1=51, s1StartIdx!=0, midGCount=0）：修复前 FAIL 19.8%，修复后 PASS 0.02%\n- Risk2 用例（config=3, s2BaseSize=256）：PASS\n- midGCount >= 1 的正常场景保留原始模板优化路径，性能不受影响\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：","assignees_number":25,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c2315759d71b2d89a80e41","login":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","name":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode","assignee":true,"code